## Store credentials (gitignored). Copy to store.properties and fill in.
## Everything here is a live secret: never commit the real file.
##
## META_APP_SECRET: Dashboard → app → API tab (or a user token from
##   Dashboard → Account). Used only by scripts/upload-store.sh.
## KEYSTORE_*: release signing key. Create once with:
##   keytool -genkeypair -keystore ~/secure/00widget.jks -alias upload \
##     -keyalg RSA -keysize 2048 -validity 9125
##   Back the .jks up off-machine; losing it orphans the listing.
## Public listing metadata (not secret, but per-deployment: keep the real
## values in this gitignored file so committed docs stay domain-free).
## Shown in Settings → About.
# PRIVACY_URL=https://example.com/privacy
# TERMS_URL=https://example.com/terms
# META_APP_SECRET=
# KEYSTORE_FILE=
# KEYSTORE_PASSWORD=
# KEY_ALIAS=upload
# KEY_PASSWORD=
